# A1_11 "Zainsubani Informant": a day after the Vivec report, Caius sends the
# player to Hassour Zainsubani in Ald'ruhn, who talks for a thoughtful gift.
# PositionCell stands in for the walks; the console's timescale stands in for
# the day of waiting, and the ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from a1_11_orders
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Caius counts the days himself; once one has passed he has new orders.
case a1_11_orders
run
player->PositionCell -35 -110 80 180 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
console set timescale to 2000
until 3600 "caius cosades".localdaysPassed >= 1
console set timescale to 20
talk caius cosades
ask Orders
expect GetJournalIndex A1_11_ZainsubaniInformant == 1
bye
end

# Asked about his customs (business, choice 1), Hassour hints at the gift he
# would like.
case a1_11_meet
run
player->PositionCell 700 -1505 -220 90 "Ald-ruhn, Ald Skar Inn"
until 600 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, Ald Skar Inn" == 1
talk hassour zainsubani
ask business
choose 1
ask thoughtful gift
expect GetJournalIndex A1_11_ZainsubaniInformant == 20
bye
end

# The bookseller's copy of "Ashland Hymns" (ref 0583D023), off his shelf.
case a1_11_book
run
player->PositionCell -250 -20 -100 270 "Ald-ruhn, Codus Callonus: Bookseller"
until 600 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, Codus Callonus: Bookseller" == 1
wait 30
console 0583D023.activate player
take 0583D023
close Book Menu
until 300 player->GetItemCount bk_ashland_hymns == 1
end

# The gift warms him, and he tells of the Ashlanders and their prophecies.
case a1_11_notes
run
player->PositionCell 700 -1505 -220 90 "Ald-ruhn, Ald Skar Inn"
until 600 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, Ald Skar Inn" == 1
talk hassour zainsubani
ask thoughtful gift
expect GetJournalIndex A1_11_ZainsubaniInformant == 31
ask Ashlanders
expect GetJournalIndex A1_11_ZainsubaniInformant == 50
expect player->GetItemCount bk_a1_11_zainsubaninotes == 1
bye
end

# Caius reads the notes, decodes the Emperor's package and sends the player to
# the Urshilaku camp: three "Continue"s.
case a1_11_report
run
player->PositionCell -35 -110 80 180 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
talk caius cosades
ask Orders
choose 1
choose 2
choose 3
expect GetJournalIndex A2_1_MeetSulMatuul == 1
expect player->GetItemCount bk_a1_1_packagedecoded == 1
bye
end
